    Run,
    477,
    "Ego nyene, izo nyungu z'umurengera zivuye mu kununuza kw'igihe kirekire abanyagihugu ba Filipine nikwo kwabaye ishingiro ry'inyungu z'intwaro y'amahanga ya Amerika.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    530,
    "Ingaburo z'ibiterwa zikunze kuboneka zobaye ari indemamubiri zisangwa mu mababi no mu mboga, ariko ivyo biragora umubiri nk'uwa twebwe inkende ko wobisya kiretse bitetse.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    558,
    "Naho inzira y’imikogote yari igizwe n’imbaho ​​zibangikanije gusa, amafarasi yayikwega yaranyaruka kandi agakwega n’imizigo myinshi kuruta amabarabara asanzwe.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    572,
    "Hasigaye amakopi yonyene mu mpapuro ziswe 25 Dunlap broadsides. Izari zanditswe n’iminwe ntazikiriho.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    573,
    "Benshi mu bashakashatsi bajejwe kwiga ibjanye na kahise k’abantu n’akibikoko bemeza ko bimwe mu bikoko vyitwa dinozoro vyoba bikiriho. Ubu tuzita inyoni.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    603,
    "Gusa iyo sellile zikuru z'umuntu zihindutse, zirashobora kwandukira no ku bana uwo muntu azovyara, mu gihe ihinduka ryo kubindi bice rishobora gutuma umuntu apfa canke bigatera kanseri.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    669,
    "Igihe ibikoresho vyose bihari bikoreshejwe neza mu bisata vy'ubuzima bw'ishirahamwe, ubuhanga bwo kwiyumvira ibintu bishasha n'ubugirigiri birashobora kwibonekeza.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    685,
    "Gutembera biciye ku buhinga bwa none biratanga n'akaryo keza ko kwiyumvira urwo rugendo maze mukazoyagira abandi banyeshure ivyo mwabonye.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    698,
    "Madagasikari ni nini cane gose birengeje, n'umugabane wikwije ubwawo kagezwe k'ubidukikije.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    769,
    "Apia yatangujwe mu myaka ya 1850. Ni wo murwa mukuru wa Samoa kuva mu 1959.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    790,
    "Abakora ivy'ingendo kenshi baratunganya ivy'icayi, ukwiyunguruza uja canke uva ku kibuga c'indege, canke mbere bagafatanya ivy'urugendo rw'indege n'ivy'amahoteli.",
  ),
  (Run, 823, "Ingenzi zirashobora guhura n'udukoko zitamenyereye iwabo."),
  (
    Run,
    835,
    "Nimba wipfuza udugato dutoyi mugabo turimwo ibikwiye, uragerageza utwo bita Berliner, Pfannkuchen canke Krapfen bivanye n'intara.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    853,
    "Kugendana isakoshi ku mugongo wambaye ibirato vya ski: Bavyita kandi ski yo hagati mu gihugu, urugendo rwa ski canke gutembera n'amaguru ugira ku birato vya ski.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    902,
    "Ibirango vyamanitswe kuma piramide kandi ama piramide atandukanye aramurikiwe.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    906,
    "Ellsworth Land ni akarere ko m' ubumanuko bwa Peninsula, kagaburwa n' ikiyaga ca Bellingshausen.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    919,
    "Naho umugwi w’amazinga yo hafi y'inkengera hamwe n’ibiyaga binini vyagutse ku buryo vyokwakira ubwato ubwo ari bwo bwose, ubwato butobuto canke ubwitwa kayake butuma wiyumva ukundi.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    921,
    "Ivyo birakorwa no muri Noroveji, Swede no muri Nuvere Zerande, ariko hoho hari ico hisangije (akarorero: mu Buholande usanga ari ubwato bumwe ku bantu mirongine.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    922,
    "Menshi muma Meri y'i Balte atandukanye aratanga akaryo ko kumara igihe kirekire i St. Petersburg, mubu Russia.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    927,
    "Si ikintu cogutera isoni: ntigitandukanye n' ubwoba bw'umuntu bwite hamwe no kudakunda kw'ibindi bintu abantu benshi cane bafise.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    980,
    "Ntivyari bikenewe no kuvugwa, uzi neza ururimi rw'iki Romani, bizokworohera kwiga ikinya Portugale.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    986,
    "Ico ciyumviro cavuye mu Bushinwa aho amashurwe yiyuguruye yaba ariyo mashurwe acagurwa.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    991,
    "Ariko gushirwa mu \"bibanza bikirurutse\" ku rugero ruto uduze mu maja ruguru ya ekwateri uzokenera guhangana na bibiri ubushuhe (imisi yose) n'izuba rikaze (mu gihe ikirere gikeye, ariko gake).",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    992,
    "Hariho bisi nkeya kandi zija mu maja ruguru i Hebroni, ikibanza c'akaranga c'amaziko c'abashingantahe bo muri Bibiliya nka Aburahamu, Isaka, Yakobo n'abagore babo.",
  ),
  (
    Run,
    1000,
    "Ego cane hariho insiguro za Gikristu z'ivy'idini z'uyu mugirwa, ariko ushobora gusa kuba umugirwa w'Urushana n'Irondoka w'Abakristu bambere.",
  ),
]

///|
let rows_plt : Array[(@mbglot.Lang, Int32, String)] = [
  (
    Plt,
    88,
    "Teorika ny asa vita tamin’ny ankapobeny, fa nosoratana ilay programa mba hanaovana sarisary ny fandinihana ny vahindanitra Sagittaire.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    92,
    "Ity teoria ity dia milaza fa ny ankamaroan’ny zavatra mainty manodidina ny vahindanitra dia mipetraka manodidina ny vahindanitra toy ny karazana tara-pahazavana, izay vita amin’ny singa madinika be dia be.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    115,
    "Tavoahangy kelina vaksinin’ny aretin’ny ati-doha an-tapitrisany maro ihany koa no nampanantenain’ny governemanta, izay hanampy amin’ny fanomanana sampandraharaha ara-pahasalamana amin’ny herintaona.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    116,
    "Ny drafitry ny fizarana vaksiny amin’ity taona ity any amin’ireo faritra izay voakasika indrindra ara-tantara dia nahemotra noho ny tsy fisian’ny vola sy ny tsy maha laharampahamehana azy raha oharina amin’ny aretina hafa.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    119,
    "Fanta-daza amin’ny hatsaran’ny kalitao sy ny antsipirihany ery ny asany, hany ka lasa anisan’ireo “anarana malaza” tsy dia fahita matetika ao amin’ny mpanangona hajia izy.Ny mpanangona hajia sasany aza dia lasa matihanina mihitsy amin’ny fanangonana ny asany irery.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    120,
    "Ilay “Zava-tsoa Nataon’ny Mpanjakan’ny Soeda” nosoratan’i David Klöker Ehrenstrahl tamin’ny 2000 no boky faha-1000 tsara indrindra ao aminy, izay anisan’ny boky notehirizina tao amin’ny Guinness Book of World.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    138,
    "Nilaina ity antsanga ity mba hamoronana dongom-pasika sy morontsiraka, izay nampiasaina ho toeramponenan’’ny bibidia.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    139,
    "Vokatr’izany dia nisy karazana trondro roa lany tamingana, ary misy roa hafa indray atahorana ho lany tamingana, anisan’izany ny humpback chub.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    198,
    "Raha ny nambaran’ny polisy dia mety tsy ho voasazy noho ny heloka bevava ny mpitondra ilay fiara nandona ilay mpaka sary.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    240,
    "Ny mpiara-mihazakazaka aminy, Fernando Alonzo, dia nitarika foana nandritra ny ankamaroan’ny hazakazaka, fa namita izany taorian’ny nijanonany teo amin’ny stand, angamba noho ny kodiarana aloha ankavanana tsy nipetraka tsara.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    256,
    "Nahitàna asidra sianorika sy melamine ny santionan'amanin'ireo biby fiompy an-trano izay maty taorian’ny nihinanany sakafom-biby voapoizina.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    269,
    "I Nicholas Alden, 25 taona, sy Zachary Cuddeback, 21 taona no maty tamin'izany. I Cuddeback no nitondra ny fiara.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    282,
    "Kanefa nahitana ratra mafy ny teo amin’ny lohan’ilay mpamily.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    330,
    "Azo eritreretina ho nitondra rano ho an'ny tany sy raha organika afaka mamorona proteinina sy manohana ny fiainana ireo kômeta.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    457,
    "Ny Revôlisiôna Frantsay dia nanentana ny mpiasa madinika maro amin’ny firenena hafa hanomboka ny revôlisiônany.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    477,
    "Mazava ho azy fa ny tombom-barotra goavana azo tamin'ny fanararaotana nampiasa naharitra ny olona avy any Philippine no natao handrafitra ny tombony fototra azon'ny imperialisma amerikanina.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    530,
    "Ireo sakafo avy amin’ny zavamaniry mora azo indrindra dia ny prôteina ao amin’ny ravina sy legioma, nefa sarotra ho an’ny primate toa antsika ny handevona azy ireny raha tsy hoe andrahoina.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    558,
    "Na dia vita tamin’ny hazo fisaka fotsiny aza ny kalesy, dia afaka nitarika azy tamin’ny hafainganam-pandeha bebe kokoa sy ny nitarika entana mavesatra kokoa ireo soavaly mpitarika noho ny tamin’ireo lalana nikitoantoana tamin’izany fotoana izany.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    572,
    "Ireo pirinty 25 an’i Dunlap izay fantatra fa mbola misy no dika antintra mbola velona amin’ilay tahirin-kevitra. Ilay dika sora-tanana voalohany dia tsy tafita velona.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    573,
    "Paleontolojista maro ankehitriny no mino fa nisy antokona dinôsôro anakiray tafavoaka velona ary mbola velona ankehitriny. Vorona no iantsoantsika azy ireny.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    603,
    "Ny fiovàn’ny sela vokarin’ny mpamokatra ihany no afaka mifindra amin’ny zanaka, raha toa ka mety hiteraka fahafatesan’ny sela na homamiadana ny fiovàna amin’ny toeran-kafa.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    669,
    "Rehefa ampiasaina amin’ny fomba mahomby ireo loharano rehetra eo anivon’ireo sampandraharaha miasa ao anatin’ny fikambanana iray, dia mety hipoitra ny fahaizamamorona sy ny hakingantsaina.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    685,
    "Ny fizarana ny dia izay natao amin’ny alalan’ny fitantarana dia fomba tsara anehoana ilay dia ary ahafahana miza traikefa ho an’ireo kilsy manaraka.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    698,
    "Madagasikara no lehibe indrindra hatreto, ary tanibe iray mihitsy raha resaka bibidia.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    769,
    "Tany amin’ny taona 1850 tany i Apia no naorina ary lasa renivohitra ofisialn’ny Samoa nanomboka tamin’ny 1959.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    790,
    "Ny mpandraharaha ara-pizahantany matetika dia manana tolotra izay misy sakafo maraina, lamina amin’ny fitaterana ho eny/avy eny amin’ny seranam-piaramanidina na koa tolotra manakambana ny sidina sy ny trano fandraisam-bahiny.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    823,
    "Mety hahita biby mpanimba izay tsy fahitany any amin’ny faritra niaviany ireo mpandeha.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    835,
    "Raha mila mofomamy kely nefa matsiro ianareo dia andramo ny antsoina hoe Berliner, Pfannkuchen na Krapfen, arakaraka ny toerana ny anarany.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    853,
    "Backpacking ski: io dia antsoina ihany koa hoe backcountry ski, fandehandehanana amin’ny ski na fiakarana amin’ny ski.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    902,
    "Miseho amin’ireo piramida ny seho ary mirehitra avokoa ireo piramida isan-karazany.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    906,
    "Ellsworth dia faritra atsimon’ilay nosy izay voadidin’ny ranomasina Bellingshausen.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    919,
    "Na dia lehibe tsara antonina ny sambo yacht aza ny vondronosy manodidina sy ny farihy lehibe dia miavaka kokoa ny mampiasa sambo kely na kayak.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    921,
    "Mitovy izany any Nôrvezy, Soedy sy Novely Zelandy, miavaka ihany kosa izy ankoatra izay (ohatra, any Pays Bas dia iray anatin’ny efapolo izany).",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    922,
    "Ny ankamaroan’ny mpampitsangatsangana an-tsambo balte tsirairay dia afaka mikarakara fijanonana elaela kokoa any St. Petersburg, any Rosia.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    927,
    "Tsy zavatra mahamenatra mihitsy izany: Tsy misy mahasamihafa azy amin’ireo tahotra sy tsy fitiavan-javatra hananan’olona maro izany.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    980,
    "Tsy ilaina lazaina fa rehefa mahay fiteny romana ianao dia ho mora ho anao ny hianatra ny fiteny portogey.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    986,
    "Niainga avy any Sina ny hevitra satria any dia ny felam-paiso no voninkazon voasafidy.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    991,
    "Fa noho ny fipetrahany amin’ny “zanapehintany avo”, degre vitsivitsy monja any avaratry ny Ekoatera, dia sady mila miatrika ny hafanana (lalandava) ianao no miatrika ny masoandro mahery (rehefa mazava ny lanitra, mahalana kokoa).",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    992,
    "Misy fiara fitaterana vitsivitsy ihany koa mandeha any avaratra ho any Hebrona, ilay toerana nentim-paharazana izay nandevenana ireo patriarakan’ny Baiboly Abrahama, Isaka, Jakoba sy ireo vadin’izy ireo.",
  ),
  (
    Plt,
    1000,
    "Mazava ho azy fa misy fanazavana teolojika kristiana izany fomba izany, nefa mety ho fomba fanao mifandray amin’ny fiterahana amin’ny lohataona izany.",
  ),
]

